{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "nw8me5ug0i9tkg35", "title": "94.TensorFlow模型训练环境安装", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"uf4ca696f\" id=\"uf4ca696f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4500da3\" id=\"uf4500da3\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b0c1578\" id=\"u0b0c1578\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F2424104%2F1745804258492-085a4599-f003-4e84-8b1a-d23f6d1679f9.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22tensorflow-env.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A129591%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u9efc956c-47a1-44d7-83c7-149c46a5cef%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9e5cf7ed%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2a34d5f0\" id=\"u2a34d5f0\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9eed3d13\" id=\"u9eed3d13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"dN8lX\" id=\"dN8lX\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0de20216\" id=\"u0de20216\">安装</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u7cd48417\" id=\"u7cd48417\"><span data-lake-id=\"u84b44766\" id=\"u84b44766\">安装TensorFlow模型训练环境、设置缓存，并选择性配置 </span><span data-lake-id=\"ub69db8fb\" id=\"ub69db8fb\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud35e4de9\" id=\"ud35e4de9\"> Transformers 以离线运行。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3c3deaf1\" id=\"u3c3deaf1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u365d04ce\" id=\"u365d04ce\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1be1f841\" id=\"u1be1f841\"> Transformers 已在 Python 3.6+、PyTorch 1.1.0+、TensorFlow 2.0+ 以及 Flax 上进行测试。针对你使用的深度学习框架，请参照以下安装说明进行安装：</span></p><ul list=\"ue207638e\"><li fid=\"u6de615b1\" data-lake-id=\"u918e4a9b\" id=\"u918e4a9b\"><a href=\"https://pytorch.org/get-started/locally/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3f80041d\" id=\"u3f80041d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43119a74\" id=\"u43119a74\">PyTorch</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u389fd672\" id=\"u389fd672\"> 安装说明。</span></li><li fid=\"u6de615b1\" data-lake-id=\"u67e2cddc\" id=\"u67e2cddc\"><a href=\"https://www.tensorflow.org/install/pip\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u8d346218\" id=\"u8d346218\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f457f69\" id=\"u6f457f69\">TensorFlow 2.0</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u8b58ec4f\" id=\"u8b58ec4f\"> 安装说明。</span></li><li fid=\"u6de615b1\" data-lake-id=\"u41d210dc\" id=\"u41d210dc\"><a href=\"https://flax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u6ddf19ad\" id=\"u6ddf19ad\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub5440523\" id=\"ub5440523\">Flax</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u46498249\" id=\"u46498249\"> 安装说明。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"goKnC\" id=\"goKnC\"><span data-lake-id=\"uac8eaf47\" id=\"uac8eaf47\">使用 pip 安装</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ua74e9cd9\" id=\"ua74e9cd9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u27af9af2\" id=\"u27af9af2\">你应该使用 </span><a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u274fe667\" id=\"u274fe667\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7aef014\" id=\"ub7aef014\">虚拟环境</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ua8a1b691\" id=\"ua8a1b691\"> 安装 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u9bfd6c02\" id=\"u9bfd6c02\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u4809cd4a\" id=\"u4809cd4a\"> Transformers。如果你不熟悉 Python 虚拟环境，请查看此 </span><a href=\"https://packaging.python.org/guides/installing-using-pip-and-virtual-environments/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ufeddff4d\" id=\"ufeddff4d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b86b3ae\" id=\"u0b86b3ae\">教程</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ub074a4f1\" id=\"ub074a4f1\">。使用虚拟环境，你可以轻松管理不同项目，避免不同依赖项之间的兼容性问题。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uffa9eba3\" id=\"uffa9eba3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36ec41c6\" id=\"u36ec41c6\">首先，在项目目录中创建conda环境：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22conda%20create%20--name%20tf%20%20python%3D3.9%5Cnconda%20activate%20tf%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Afalse%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B1%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22tHYTZ%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u5f33931d\" id=\"u5f33931d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u593034fb\" id=\"u593034fb\">现在你可以使用以下命令安装 </span><span data-lake-id=\"ucaa80aeb\" id=\"ucaa80aeb\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua10b5e03\" id=\"ua10b5e03\"> Transformers：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20transformers%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mT1Ma%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud461f160\" id=\"ud461f160\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6cc50ae2\" id=\"u6cc50ae2\">若仅需 CPU 支持，可以使用单行命令方便地安装 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u41693e7b\" id=\"u41693e7b\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u049bf745\" id=\"u049bf745\"> Transformers 和深度学习库。例如，使用以下命令安装 </span><span data-lake-id=\"ucc3ef8c7\" id=\"ucc3ef8c7\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u7bded220\" id=\"u7bded220\"> Transformers 和 PyTorch：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20'transformers%5Btorch%5D'%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AHXgT%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua3705747\" id=\"ua3705747\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe6d52ef\" id=\"ufe6d52ef\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0a420304\" id=\"u0a420304\"> Transformers 和 TensorFlow 2.0：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20'transformers%5Btf-cpu%5D'%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xlumb%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u057280b1\" id=\"u057280b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f4546c3\" id=\"u5f4546c3\"> M1 / ARM用户 在安装 TensorFlow 2.0 前，你需要安装以下库：brew install cmake brew install pkg-config</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u69e338f5\" id=\"u69e338f5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda0cdc0b\" id=\"uda0cdc0b\" style=\"color: #080808; background-color: #ffffff\">windows系统，先安装cmake工具</span><span data-lake-id=\"u4d73a244\" id=\"u4d73a244\">：</span><a href=\"https://cmake.org/download/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u95582a38\" id=\"u95582a38\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31d619c0\" id=\"u31d619c0\">https://cmake.org/download/</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4cae58fa\" id=\"u4cae58fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8c33d84a\" id=\"u8c33d84a\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue4fc7988\" id=\"ue4fc7988\"> Transformers 和 Flax:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20'transformers%5Bflax%5D'%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O5rDa%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua5c23262\" id=\"ua5c23262\"><span data-lake-id=\"uef04121f\" id=\"uef04121f\">最后，运行以下命令以检查 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u448c1d01\" id=\"u448c1d01\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5f6e2bde\" id=\"u5f6e2bde\"> Transformers 是否已被正确安装。该命令将下载一个预训练模型：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20-c%20%5C%22from%20transformers%20import%20pipeline%3B%20print(pipeline('sentiment-analysis')('we%20love%20you'))%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h0AoK%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u97d774d6\" id=\"u97d774d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u05f33ecc\" id=\"u05f33ecc\">然后打印标签以及分数：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B%7B'label'%3A%20'POSITIVE'%2C%20'score'%3A%200.9998704791069031%7D%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TlkFB%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"wiYlY\" id=\"wiYlY\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c17db8f\" id=\"u3c17db8f\">源码安装</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"udd648ba2\" id=\"udd648ba2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue283b249\" id=\"ue283b249\">使用以下命令从源码安装 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u495f3149\" id=\"u495f3149\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u277044f2\" id=\"u277044f2\"> Transformers：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pip%20install%20git%2Bhttps%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22APFQI%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud8a7f5c1\" id=\"ud8a7f5c1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u857a0918\" id=\"u857a0918\">此命令下载的是最新的前沿 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u710cdf9a\" id=\"u710cdf9a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue11e86a3\" id=\"ue11e86a3\">main</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u87089288\" id=\"u87089288\"> 版本而不是最新的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u6870f5aa\" id=\"u6870f5aa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8101798b\" id=\"u8101798b\">stable</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uebad2bad\" id=\"uebad2bad\"> 版本。</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua6a6fc10\" id=\"ua6a6fc10\"><span data-lake-id=\"u24415173\" id=\"u24415173\">main</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8f6dcd17\" id=\"u8f6dcd17\"> 版本适用于跟最新开发保持一致。例如，上次正式版发布带来的 bug 被修复了，但新版本尚未被推出。但是，这也说明 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u34e81cc3\" id=\"u34e81cc3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c0e9684\" id=\"u5c0e9684\">main</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uaec1ff27\" id=\"uaec1ff27\"> 版本并不一定总是稳定的。我们努力保持 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u845373d3\" id=\"u845373d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue8e4d908\" id=\"ue8e4d908\">main</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u70d96d57\" id=\"u70d96d57\"> 版本的可操作性，大多数问题通常在几个小时或一天以内就能被解决。如果你遇到问题，请提个 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/issues\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4611a721\" id=\"u4611a721\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4e3e590\" id=\"uc4e3e590\">Issue</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uad410472\" id=\"uad410472\"> 以便我们能更快修复。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufe51de2e\" id=\"ufe51de2e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b357578\" id=\"u9b357578\">运行以下命令以检查 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u0729818f\" id=\"u0729818f\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud4cc77b0\" id=\"ud4cc77b0\"> Transformers 是否已被正确安装：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20-c%20%5C%22from%20transformers%20import%20pipeline%3B%20print(pipeline('sentiment-analysis')('I%20love%20you'))%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q06OQ%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"aAkc6\" id=\"aAkc6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf63b392\" id=\"ubf63b392\">可编辑安装</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u98d50e80\" id=\"u98d50e80\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua47be235\" id=\"ua47be235\">如果你有下列需求，需要进行可编辑安装：</span></p><ul list=\"udaf125a3\"><li fid=\"ub03214e0\" data-lake-id=\"u2d8c9576\" id=\"u2d8c9576\"><span data-lake-id=\"u91b07f66\" id=\"u91b07f66\">使用源码的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ufdf5e904\" id=\"ufdf5e904\"><span data-lake-id=\"uad3d0605\" id=\"uad3d0605\">main</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8677ba1d\" id=\"u8677ba1d\"> 版本。</span></li><li fid=\"ub03214e0\" data-lake-id=\"ud312665f\" id=\"ud312665f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a3680d6\" id=\"u0a3680d6\">为 </span><span data-lake-id=\"udfc14490\" id=\"udfc14490\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5cac25e5\" id=\"u5cac25e5\"> Transformers 贡献代码，需要测试代码中的更改。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u78d90758\" id=\"u78d90758\"><span data-lake-id=\"u59780a15\" id=\"u59780a15\">使用以下命令克隆仓库并安装 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u7ecc5a74\" id=\"u7ecc5a74\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"uff4b8ab3\" id=\"uff4b8ab3\"> Transformers：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22git%20clone%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fhuggingface%2Ftransformers.git%5Cncd%20transformers%5Cnpip%20install%20-e%20.%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DM66O%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u25414b92\" id=\"u25414b92\"><span data-lake-id=\"u17bd3f25\" id=\"u17bd3f25\">这些命令将会链接你克隆的仓库以及你的 Python 库路径。现在，Python 不仅会在正常的库路径中搜索库，也会在你克隆到的文件夹中进行查找。例如，如果你的 Python 包通常本应安装在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud404de56\" id=\"ud404de56\"><span data-lake-id=\"u430b26a1\" id=\"u430b26a1\">~/anaconda3/envs/main/lib/python3.7/site-packages/</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6fbb8cdf\" id=\"u6fbb8cdf\"> 目录中，在这种情况下 Python 也会搜索你克隆到的文件夹：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u0925a61d\" id=\"u0925a61d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38b97271\" id=\"u38b97271\">~/transformers/</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0d323aaa\" id=\"u0d323aaa\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9550ab62\" id=\"u9550ab62\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b731cfd\" id=\"u7b731cfd\"> 如果你想继续使用这个库，必须保留 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uec177076\" id=\"uec177076\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0a4feac\" id=\"ub0a4feac\">transformers</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue63e3ee9\" id=\"ue63e3ee9\"> 文件夹。 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub682a4fc\" id=\"ub682a4fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u186f58ec\" id=\"u186f58ec\">现在，你可以使用以下命令，将你克隆的 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u1bb6a3d5\" id=\"u1bb6a3d5\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub5741ac3\" id=\"ub5741ac3\"> Transformers 库轻松更新至最新版本：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22cd%20~%2Ftransformers%2F%5Cngit%20pull%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FvDKb%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u70af3eae\" id=\"u70af3eae\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c4b7ac0\" id=\"u1c4b7ac0\">你的 Python 环境将在下次运行时找到 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u954dc0db\" id=\"u954dc0db\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc6a8897c\" id=\"uc6a8897c\">main</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7f68cb8c\" id=\"u7f68cb8c\"> 版本的 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u1dedc220\" id=\"u1dedc220\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u09737f26\" id=\"u09737f26\"> Transformers。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"H8egB\" id=\"H8egB\"><span data-lake-id=\"u099a2465\" id=\"u099a2465\">使用 conda 安装</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u604404b1\" id=\"u604404b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2200c223\" id=\"u2200c223\">从 conda 的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u939a7975\" id=\"u939a7975\"><span data-lake-id=\"u589b85ab\" id=\"u589b85ab\">conda-forge</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u520d08a2\" id=\"u520d08a2\"> 频道安装：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22conda%20install%20conda-forge%3A%3Atransformers%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uNy78%22%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"iFFug\" id=\"iFFug\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6e59d466\" id=\"u6e59d466\">缓存设置</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ue1a4b5b6\" id=\"ue1a4b5b6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u28ae48a6\" id=\"u28ae48a6\">预训练模型会被下载并本地缓存到 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9644daa2\" id=\"u9644daa2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e791290\" id=\"u5e791290\">~/.cache/huggingface/hub</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uea199dff\" id=\"uea199dff\">。这是由环境变量 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5acaa52e\" id=\"u5acaa52e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u219ba2d1\" id=\"u219ba2d1\">TRANSFORMERS_CACHE</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8d74eb7d\" id=\"u8d74eb7d\"> 指定的默认目录。在 Windows 上，默认目录为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u0a433e31\" id=\"u0a433e31\"><span data-lake-id=\"u29e52bc9\" id=\"u29e52bc9\">C:\\Users\\username\\.cache\\huggingface\\hub</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3045b9bc\" id=\"u3045b9bc\">。你可以按照不同优先级改变下述环境变量，以指定不同的缓存目录。</span></p><ol list=\"uc24ed98c\"><li fid=\"ue1fb0b0f\" data-lake-id=\"ua93295a7\" id=\"ua93295a7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4eb60b86\" id=\"u4eb60b86\">环境变量（默认）: </span><code data-lake-id=\"u779ae59a\" id=\"u779ae59a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u819cb84e\" id=\"u819cb84e\">HF_HUB_CACHE</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u77b16d94\" id=\"u77b16d94\"> 或 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ua0628554\" id=\"ua0628554\"><span data-lake-id=\"udbc6275f\" id=\"udbc6275f\">TRANSFORMERS_CACHE</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3f73701c\" id=\"u3f73701c\">。</span></li><li fid=\"ue1fb0b0f\" data-lake-id=\"u0f29a180\" id=\"u0f29a180\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe96bdd4\" id=\"ufe96bdd4\">环境变量 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf72cc021\" id=\"uf72cc021\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd0baa75\" id=\"udd0baa75\">HF_HOME</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uec3cc26b\" id=\"uec3cc26b\">。</span></li><li fid=\"ue1fb0b0f\" data-lake-id=\"u1097a055\" id=\"u1097a055\"><span data-lake-id=\"u637d319f\" id=\"u637d319f\">环境变量 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u135fc04a\" id=\"u135fc04a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4ef436c3\" id=\"u4ef436c3\">XDG_CACHE_HOME</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1a8e6752\" id=\"u1a8e6752\"> + </span><code data-lake-id=\"u144d8654\" id=\"u144d8654\"><span data-lake-id=\"u29839284\" id=\"u29839284\">/huggingface</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4d0b640a\" id=\"u4d0b640a\">。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ua7dbaa43\" id=\"ua7dbaa43\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub8b93667\" id=\"ub8b93667\"> 除非你明确指定了环境变量 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u05d0f3a0\" id=\"u05d0f3a0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2dc40786\" id=\"u2dc40786\">TRANSFORMERS_CACHE</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua3c42db6\" id=\"ua3c42db6\">，</span><span data-lake-id=\"u463d24bd\" id=\"u463d24bd\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u43869d03\" id=\"u43869d03\"> Transformers 将可能会使用较早版本设置的环境变量 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u79d5ea7f\" id=\"u79d5ea7f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u794a5cf6\" id=\"u794a5cf6\">PYTORCH_TRANSFORMERS_CACHE</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud1100cdd\" id=\"ud1100cdd\"> 或 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf39ffb07\" id=\"uf39ffb07\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16611384\" id=\"u16611384\">PYTORCH_PRETRAINED_BERT_CACHE</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u25554ccf\" id=\"u25554ccf\">。 </span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"jo85V\" id=\"jo85V\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca0935bc\" id=\"uca0935bc\">离线模式</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u5ad47abc\" id=\"u5ad47abc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f89ac6d\" id=\"u6f89ac6d\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"u51fea506\" id=\"u51fea506\"> Transformers 可以仅使用本地文件在防火墙或离线环境中运行。设置环境变量 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ube1f7d08\" id=\"ube1f7d08\"><span data-lake-id=\"u658324a2\" id=\"u658324a2\">HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf518b6df\" id=\"uf518b6df\"> 以启用该行为。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc30f9770\" id=\"uc30f9770\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2fa2c17\" id=\"ub2fa2c17\"> 通过设置环境变量 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ufb65290f\" id=\"ufb65290f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5a16429\" id=\"ue5a16429\">HF_DATASETS_OFFLINE=1</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc21010c8\" id=\"uc21010c8\"> 将 </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/datasets/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u79ed48aa\" id=\"u79ed48aa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3d287351\" id=\"u3d287351\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf25bb678\" id=\"uf25bb678\"> Datasets</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u42f3a642\" id=\"u42f3a642\"> 添加至你的离线训练工作流程中。 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u98b7533d\" id=\"u98b7533d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0c293b3\" id=\"ub0c293b3\">例如，你通常会使用以下命令对外部实例进行防火墙保护的的普通网络上运行程序：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20examples%2Fpytorch%2Ftranslation%2Frun_translation.py%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20--do_train%20--do_eval%20%20--output_dir%20%2Ftmp%2Ftst-translation%20--source_lang%20en%20--target_lang%20ro%20--dataset_name%20wmt16%20--dataset_config%20ro-en%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22pwbhm%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u21b8cdfb\" id=\"u21b8cdfb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u61e1eefc\" id=\"u61e1eefc\">在离线环境中运行相同的程序：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22HF_DATASETS_OFFLINE%3D1%20HF_HUB_OFFLINE%3D1%20%5C%5C%5Cnpython%20examples%2Fpytorch%2Ftranslation%2Frun_translation.py%20--model_name_or_path%20google-t5%2Ft5-small%20--dataset_name%20wmt16%20--dataset_config%20ro-en%20...%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__height%22%3A67.15577697753906%2C%22id%22%3A%22mo18U%22%2C%22height%22%3A67.15577697753906%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua91c5ce4\" id=\"ua91c5ce4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0a96637\" id=\"ua0a96637\">现在脚本可以应该正常运行，而无需挂起或等待超时，因为它知道只应查找本地文件。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"xDHZa\" id=\"xDHZa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a9b6936\" id=\"u5a9b6936\">获取离线时使用的模型和分词器</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u6223a848\" id=\"u6223a848\"><span data-lake-id=\"uabcd50bc\" id=\"uabcd50bc\">另一种离线时使用 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u502d4e60\" id=\"u502d4e60\">🤗</span><span data-lake-id=\"udd9cdadd\" id=\"udd9cdadd\"> Transformers 的方法是预先下载好文件，然后在需要离线使用时指向它们的离线路径。有三种实现的方法：</span></p><ul list=\"u08d43785\"><li fid=\"u9eadcd20\" data-lake-id=\"uec133b40\" id=\"uec133b40\"><span data-lake-id=\"u91fa521f\" id=\"u91fa521f\">单击 </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/models\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u25d20d96\" id=\"u25d20d96\"><span data-lake-id=\"u57011dfd\" id=\"u57011dfd\">Model Hub</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u4505f627\" id=\"u4505f627\"> 用户界面上的 ↓ 图标下载文件。</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue52fc8c4\" id=\"ue52fc8c4\">  </span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdatasets%2Fhuggingface%2Fdocumentation-images%2Fresolve%2Fmain%2Fdownload-icon.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A2618%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1574%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22error%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22errorMessage%22%3A%22unknown%20error%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22kH0Cf%22%7D\"></card></li><li fid=\"u9eadcd20\" data-lake-id=\"u7b3c2ef5\" id=\"u7b3c2ef5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4d4b616a\" id=\"u4d4b616a\">使用 [</span><code data-lake-id=\"u50584f58\" id=\"u50584f58\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a419e1a\" id=\"u8a419e1a\">PreTrainedModel.from_pretrained</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u465c707c\" id=\"u465c707c\">] 和 [</span><code data-lake-id=\"u76e7b5d7\" id=\"u76e7b5d7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u956572a2\" id=\"u956572a2\">PreTrainedModel.save_pretrained</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u766063fb\" id=\"u766063fb\">] 工作流程：</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20from%20transformers%20import%20AutoTokenizer%2C%20AutoModelForSeq2SeqLM%5Cn%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20tokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(%5C%22bigscience%2FT0_3B%5C%22)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20model%20%3D%20AutoModelForSeq2SeqLM.from_pretrained(%5C%22bigscience%2FT0_3B%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lsJYL%22%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20tokenizer.save_pretrained(%5C%22.%2Fyour%2Fpath%2Fbigscience_t0%5C%22)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20model.save_pretrained(%5C%22.%2Fyour%2Fpath%2Fbigscience_t0%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fnADY%22%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20tokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(%5C%22.%2Fyour%2Fpath%2Fbigscience_t0%5C%22)%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20model%20%3D%20AutoModel.from_pretrained(%5C%22.%2Fyour%2Fpath%2Fbigscience_t0%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ytYAP%22%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u08d43785\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u8629bb67\" data-lake-id=\"u84f0fbd6\" id=\"u84f0fbd6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0715ce62\" id=\"u0715ce62\">预先使用 [</span><code data-lake-id=\"u538d3fa9\" id=\"u538d3fa9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uceba009d\" id=\"uceba009d\">PreTrainedModel.from_pretrained</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6aae409a\" id=\"u6aae409a\">] 下载文件：</span></li><li fid=\"u8629bb67\" data-lake-id=\"u3c404b20\" id=\"u3c404b20\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8e879f85\" id=\"u8e879f85\">使用 [</span><code data-lake-id=\"ude894e79\" id=\"ude894e79\"><span data-lake-id=\"u23667217\" id=\"u23667217\">PreTrainedModel.save_pretrained</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua71ab4e5\" id=\"ua71ab4e5\">] 将文件保存至指定目录：</span></li><li fid=\"u8629bb67\" data-lake-id=\"u79e8627c\" id=\"u79e8627c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubedfdacb\" id=\"ubedfdacb\">现在，你可以在离线时从指定目录使用 [</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua9fccc42\" id=\"ua9fccc42\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7a79e45\" id=\"ue7a79e45\">PreTrainedModel.from_pretrained</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6e8cb523\" id=\"u6e8cb523\">] 重新加载你的文件：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u08d43785\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u9eadcd20\" data-lake-id=\"uef19bc02\" id=\"uef19bc02\"><span data-lake-id=\"u389874b3\" id=\"u389874b3\">使用代码用 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/huggingface/huggingface_hub/tree/main/src/huggingface_hub\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u71b8669e\" id=\"u71b8669e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35cfa800\" id=\"u35cfa800\">huggingface_hub</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1fe4f0ca\" id=\"u1fe4f0ca\"> 库下载文件：</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22python%20-m%20pip%20install%20huggingface_hub%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gL8dm%22%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%3E%3E%3E%20from%20huggingface_hub%20import%20hf_hub_download%5Cn%5Cn%3E%3E%3E%20hf_hub_download(repo_id%3D%5C%22bigscience%2FT0_3B%5C%22%2C%20filename%3D%5C%22config.json%5C%22%2C%20cache_dir%3D%5C%22.%2Fyour%2Fpath%2Fbigscience_t0%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QPOZS%22%7D\"></card><ol list=\"u08d43785\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u7a25c3b7\" data-lake-id=\"u6613d887\" id=\"u6613d887\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue9b0b09d\" id=\"ue9b0b09d\">在你的虚拟环境中安装 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub7414b72\" id=\"ub7414b72\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b62036d\" id=\"u9b62036d\">huggingface_hub</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8b4f1add\" id=\"u8b4f1add\"> 库：</span></li><li fid=\"u7a25c3b7\" data-lake-id=\"uea71d490\" id=\"uea71d490\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud63f126b\" id=\"ud63f126b\">使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u865c346d\" id=\"u865c346d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u26768308\" id=\"u26768308\">hf_hub_download</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u61ba531a\" id=\"u61ba531a\"> 函数将文件下载到指定路径。例如，以下命令将 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u2a89aaa8\" id=\"u2a89aaa8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u636e138a\" id=\"u636e138a\">config.json</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u19ff18aa\" id=\"u19ff18aa\"> 文件从 </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/bigscience/T0_3B\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u7636801b\" id=\"u7636801b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub58acb98\" id=\"ub58acb98\">T0</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6c641557\" id=\"u6c641557\"> 模型下载至你想要的路径：</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u307d8e8a\" id=\"u307d8e8a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55e24d7a\" id=\"u55e24d7a\">下载完文件并在本地缓存后，指定其本地路径以加载和使用该模型：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"da